  "contentHtml": "\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Blueberry pie is a golden, flaky celebration of summer, packed with juicy berries that burst with sweet flavor. Break through the buttery crust to find a warm, glossy filling brightened with a squeeze of lemon and a touch of vanilla. Every bite feels nostalgic, like sunlit afternoons and easy family gatherings. Simple to make with pantry staples and a little love, this homemade classic is pure happiness whether you share it or keep a slice all to yourself.</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-rank-math-toc-block\" id=\"rank-math-toc\"><h2>Table of Contents</h2><nav><ul><li><a href=\"#why-youll-love-this-blueberry-pie\">Why You’ll Love This blueberry pie</a></li><li><a href=\"#ingredients\">Ingredients</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-make-blueberry-pie\">How to Make Blueberry Pie</a></li><li><a href=\"#recipe-snapshot\">Recipe Snapshot</a></li><li><a href=\"#pro-tips-for-making-blueberry-pie\">Pro Tips for Making blueberry pie</a></li><li><a href=\"#how-to-serve-this-blueberry-pie\">How to Serve this blueberry pie</a></li><li><a href=\"#make-ahead-and-storage\">Make Ahead and Storage</a></li><li><a href=\"#fa-qs\">FAQs</a></li><li><a href=\"#final-thoughts\">Final Thoughts</a></li></ul></nav></div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"why-youll-love-this-blueberry-pie\"><strong>Why You’ll Love This blueberry pie</strong></h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Sweet and juicy blueberries bursting with flavor.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Easy to make with simple, wholesome ingredients.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Perfectly balanced sweetness that satisfies every craving.</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Great for any occasion, from family dinners to summer picnics.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<div id=\"wprm-recipe-container-11211\" class=\"wprm-recipe-container\" data-recipe-id=\"11211\" data-servings=\"8\"><div class=\"wprm-recipe wprm-recipe-template-meadow\"><div class=\"wprm-layout-container wprm-padding-40 meadow-header\">\n  <div class=\"wprm-layout-column